あ、そ、thank you, Ollie. I feel better about it since you think so. Ollie-senpai makes me happy you think I'm cute, I'm powerful!
Ah, so- thank you, Ollie. I feel better about it since you think so. Ollie-senpai makes me happy you think I'm cute, I'm powerful!

