216
00:30:00,246 --> 00:30:04,246
ギリギリで愛しあいましょう
Let's love each other to the limit

217
00:30:04,246 --> 00:30:07,576
嘘も燃え尽くして 夢にして
Burn up even lies and turn them into a dream

218
